    <h3 id="menu-button-chip">
        Menu Button Chip
    </h3>
    <p>
        When a chip is used to trigger a menu, it should have an
        <code>aria-expanded</code>
        ${" "}attribute to indicate the state of the menu. The text should be descriptive of the menu content, and the trailing icon should indicate that it is a menu button.
    </p>

    <div class="demo">
        <div class="demo__inner">
            <button class="filter-chip" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="filter-chip__text">
                    Sport
                </span>
                <svg
                    class="filter-chip__trailing icon icon--12"
                    width="12"
                    height="12"
                >
                    <icon-symbol name="chevron-down-16"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

